name polyhedra
category Package
revision 68770
shortdesc A TikZ package for drawing polyhedra
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides macros for creating polyhedral objects in
longdesc 2D and 3D. It requires TikZ and tikz-3dplot. The macros
longdesc provided can be used for drawing vertices, edges, rays,
longdesc polygons and cones.
runfiles size=5
 RELOC/tex/latex/polyhedra/polyhedra.sty
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/zafeirakopoulos/polyhedra.sty
catalogue-ctan /graphics/pgf/contrib/polyhedra
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics graphics pgf-tikz maths
catalogue-version 0.3
